<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CORNICK SAYS IN TALKS ON MORE DEALS.</title>
<headline>CORNICK SAYS IN TALKS ON MORE DEALS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Pat Cornick Ltd said on Thursday that it was in talks on possible transactions that could have an impact on its share price.</p>
<p>The firm warned shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings in its shares until a further announcement is made.</p>
<p>The firm also said that the issue of 750,000 new linked units, stemming from a recent deal to buy Future Bedding Group for 22 million rand, had now been fully approved by the authorities.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
